    {
      "item": "rust_node_name",
      "reviewed": false,
      "intent": "Custom tree_path name extraction for Rust impl blocks: for an impl_item node carrying a `trait` field (a trait impl), return `\"<trait> for <type>\"` using the verbatim source text of both fields, so trait impls and the inherent impl on the same type get distinct tree_path names; return None for any other node kind and for inherent impls (no `trait` field) so they fall through to the default type-field name.",
