      "source_anchor": "fn rust_node_name(node: &Node, source: &str) -> Option<String> {"
    },
    {
      "item": "CONFIG",
      "reviewed": false,
      "intent": "Define the Rust language configuration for tree_path resolution: register tree-sitter-rust grammar, .rs extension, kind mappings for fn/struct/enum/impl/trait/mod/const/static/type/macro, with impl_item names resolved by the rust_node_name custom callback (trait impls encode \"<trait> for <type>\", inherent impls fall back to the type field via name_overrides), and the rust_has_doc_comment detector for ///|//!|/** doc comments.",
